message: >-
  For general reference to the evolving Memory Prism framework, use the concept
  DOI. To cite the specific v1.0 release, use DOI 10.5281/zenodo.19287269.
title: "Memory Prism"
type: other
authors:
  - name: "Memory Prism"
version: "1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.19287268"
url: "https://www.memoryprism.com/framework"
repository-code: "https://github.com/memoryprismv1/memoryprism"
license: "CC-BY-NC-4.0"
abstract: >-
  A structural framework for examining how systems form, persist, change, and
  fail under constraint. It organizes cross-domain inquiry around memory,
  constraints, editors, and boards. It is not a predictive model or a
  replacement for disciplinary expertise.
